==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 10

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 5.33~13.33 seconds<sup>160f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*5 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[King's Mimic]] spawns as the boss after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

